### Error Types

| Java | Rust | Notes |
|----------|----------|-------|
| `throws Exception` | `Result<T, Error>` | Type-safe error handling |
| `try/catch` | `match result` or `?` | Pattern matching or propagation |
| `Throwable` | `Error` trait | Error interface |
